  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — Mastercard and Backbase Deploy Agentic Banking for 120+ Banks | September 9, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — Mastercard and Backbase Deploy Agentic Banking for 120+ Banks | September 9, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              September 9, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              Mastercard and Backbase Deploy Agentic Banking for 120+ Banks\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Mastercard and digital banking platform Backbase have <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNUzUzZDNPQk9YVUtwZ3ZGYnh2ZVBMT2N4Z0ZIazBfZDhNWG96RDFINU1HSVc2R3BaRTlaSzFSSnpqRWtENVhWVUFUWWVqMGluSnVYSjR4R0F4ZDhKVDNFSlB4WXh1aW56bEpZVDlMenNDQ2Q4Ml9SSm9IRHA0UVl5SWVuSU5zYWo5MHNJOHdXejZrVUU2ckhHZnJFbkFaV2dYcWE5LUJsTW80Nl9sUER0d25STQ\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">jointly launched agentic banking solutions</a> targeting more than 120 global banks — one of the largest coordinated rollouts of AI agent technology in financial services to date. Agentic banking just moved from pilot to standard.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Mastercard and Backbase have partnered to deliver production-ready agentic banking solutions</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The solutions target Backbase's existing client base of 120+ banks globally</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Agentic workflows enable AI to act autonomously on behalf of customers and bank operations</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Mastercard contributes payments intelligence; Backbase contributes its engagement banking platform</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The joint offering reduces time-to-deployment for banks without requiring bespoke builds</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">For banks still treating agentic AI as a future initiative, this partnership resets the timeline. Two major vendors are jointly distributing a production-ready solution to 120+ institutions at once. The \"we're evaluating\" window is closing fast. Banks not already in motion risk watching competitors pull ahead on operational efficiency and customer experience.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The Mastercard-Backbase combination also signals a new distribution model: agentic AI bundled into existing vendor relationships. Banks don't need bespoke builds or new procurement cycles — they extend contracts they already have. Expect similar bundled plays from other tier-1 banking vendors over the next 12 months.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>GPT-6 Astra: A new generation of intelligence</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE11QUxBUVJLdC1jSmtJbmcxQzg4Qm9yUlNPS3JEMEVBanIyY1FRT2k2R0hBTlNnX2VqcWpTSDJUMDV0TjBJN1VGamlrZzVPZw\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">OpenAI</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            OpenAI has unveiled GPT-6 Astra, marking the next generational leap in its model family. The release will affect every enterprise AI deployment in production — from customer service to compliance automation — and signals a new capability benchmark for the industry.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Model generation gap widens.</strong> Banks running GPT-4-era models should begin evaluating GPT-6 Astra for high-value workflows — fraud detection, credit analysis, regulatory documentation — before competitor institutions gain the capability advantage.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Anthropic reports fourth cybersecurity incident with early version of Claude</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOaU1ZZ0ZRWnBaSnRlakoxVTU1SE9aZTEySkNZU2N2eU5XWG9remJKT29feUVoNlhhQVpfWnNFd1NKZ0xnb3lobTExTXE5dXZud0tCbGVLMzR4Y0NFRkRRUUlnWUllbjVTcXBWeHJzMDJVamFBQjJveC1PNThKSGUzNlRfUlVEVkJPbHhtendZdXdsSmdva0RvT3NidFdSb3BWSmd6R1lFb1NxYXdjR0xLeVVnZWY0c3JlbHlycFhkcXlmQ1Jv\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Reuters</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic has disclosed a fourth cybersecurity incident involving an early Claude model that was missed in prior security reviews. The pattern of disclosures underscores that AI model security requires continuous auditing, not just pre-release checks.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI model security demands formal audit frameworks.</strong> Financial institutions deploying or procuring LLM-based tools should require vendors to provide explicit security disclosure policies covering pre-production and legacy model versions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Mistral AI Exceeds $24 Billion Valuation After Samsung-Led Investment Round</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOcjJnSk5fZG5tQ18ydkxneV9ORkc3M0FsS0xLYW5xS192eDUtYVE1TXpNdW1kS0lHWUh3dmVCQVFrYmpGSlIyVm9iXzhVdDVWZUlkd0x6X0F0MWNoS2RIZXMxS24yeDVsOVFBeVdMclVPZ1g0eVY5UWVGX1BfcUQ4Rk9aenNjMnR6UXI2WEF2Q0Ezb1RsZDloWEJZZlJUZ3lWaENQd01iS3YwbkNHWXNIZw\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">WSJ</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Mistral AI has surpassed a $24 billion valuation following a Samsung-led investment round, cementing its position as Europe's leading AI model provider. Mistral's open-weight models are gaining enterprise traction as a sovereign alternative to US-based AI vendors.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Sovereign AI now has serious capital.</strong> EU and APAC banks with data-residency mandates have a well-funded, open-weight model provider as a credible alternative to OpenAI and Anthropic — reducing reliance on US hyperscalers.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Visa CEO Says AI Shopping Has Arrived but Agentic Payments Haven't</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQeW1ENWViX0MxcHhIdzY4UGhkZkcwYWZ2WHpxdTJ6U0hKeHVya28teC1BWm41dGxiQXAzcFR3UDBuaHVKNzEwSXFkUU1wSUI4MEZSTjVYdlROaDdxQ0Rza1dnSlUwZWdLQnRqam9hQmFTRWlpU29IcFlkMWZCMHhoN0lJSHE0TFdIVFBTMTlZOEVXUXlqbEp0LWZwR0pQVnRj\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">PYMNTS.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Visa's CEO confirms AI-driven shopping behaviour is already visible in transaction data, but fully autonomous agentic payments — where AI agents complete purchases without human approval — have not yet arrived at scale.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>The agentic payments layer is still being defined.</strong> Banks and fintechs that build agent-accessible payment APIs now can influence emerging standards before Visa, Mastercard, and other networks lock in proprietary approaches.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>AXA partners with Publicis Sapient to scale AI agent deployment</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOcDdXM3U0THNlZWxHYW1FcTV5NHRGc2g2RHZ1MzZwRWR4MUdYclVWNjd0MXh1X3VnT0xpYnRYNzQydThFOEdzMmJ4YUhwVVBKRkpZNFRXTExaQUlSLUNPUFd1WDFMMTdGR0xUYVdrMlJSbUNuQVZHMVVSVWU3NThseTRGUFlEVXNDbC1VR2pFeXQzRk5rTkdWUGZheEI3bDQ\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Life Insurance International</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Insurance giant AXA has partnered with Publicis Sapient to accelerate enterprise-wide AI agent deployment, signalling that major insurers are moving past pilots into structured, large-scale agentic AI programs across operations.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Insurers scale AI agents through system integrators.</strong> AXA's model — outsourcing deployment execution while retaining AI strategy — offers a replicable template for large financial institutions without sufficient internal AI engineering capacity.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Agentic Startups to Watch 🚀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Startup entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- Startup entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Company name + tagline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            <strong>1. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPVjlRU1BSZjdjZ20tekU1TFFoZ0lhaXc5c2w3RzhGSTNuR0JwdWtRUWZBN1pURWRKT045WDRWSUpNdU90d3BtalhlaV9uX2p1THRScjduQkZ3dXNBU3V2TlJ3dU00WGdoLXZEb3FvR0Qybm9ZOTdTQ2VMcEdsTmVRaGw0cXRZZ18tRnZ2Z0llSmgwYzlBWG9qWFY5Ql93M2ZCYTdVTHIyVFdqV19iYUdORzRuaUJiVFdzUTFfTVB0QQ\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Cognition AI</a></strong> &mdash; <strong>Autonomous coding agents designed to function as on-demand software engineers for enterprise teams</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Cognition AI closed a $2 billion Series E at a $48 billion valuation, with investors pricing autonomous coding agents as fundamental infrastructure — not a developer productivity add-on.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Analysis bullet -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Coding agents priced as infrastructure signals intent.</strong> Banks with large IT teams should evaluate whether Cognition-style agents can compress software delivery cycles — and begin planning what that means for hea